{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29063","headline":"郑秀才东归凭达家书 · 许浑","name":"郑秀才东归凭达家书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲寄家书少客过，闭门心远洞庭波。\n两岩花落夜风急，一迳草荒春雨多。\n愁泛楚江吟浩渺，忆归吴岫梦嵯峨。\n贫居不问应知处，溪上闲船系绿萝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}